
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FAIZAL ALLYONOGAMES</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f4f5f7;color:#111}
header{background:#087b25;color:white;text-align:center;padding:25px 10px}
header h1{font-size:25px;margin:5px}
header p{margin:8px}
.container{padding:12px}
.card{background:white;border:2px solid #d5d8dc;border-radius:13px;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo{width:65px;height:65px;background:#e2f4e5;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:30px}
.info{flex:1}
.info h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}
.info p{color:#218044;font-size:13px}
.btn{background:#00ae16;color:white;padding:12px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#666}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>FAIZAL_ALLYONOGAMES</h1>
<p>Welcome to My Gaming World</p>
</header>
<div class="container">

<div class="card">
<div class="logo">♟️</div>
<div class="info">
<h2>Lichess</h2>
<p>Free Online Chess</p>
</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://lichess.org/">PLAY</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="logo">🎮</div>
<div class="info">
<h2>Scratch</h2>
<p>Free Creative Games</p>
</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://scratch.mit.edu/">PLAY</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="logo">🧩</div>
<div class="info">
<h2>Sudoku</h2>
<p>Free Puzzle Games</p>
</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://sudoku.com/">PLAY</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="logo">🌍</div>
<div class="info">
<h2>GeoGuessr</h2>
<p>Explore the World</p>
</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.geoguessr.com/">PLAY</a>
</div>

</div>
<footer>
<p>© 2026 FAIZAL_ALLYONOGAMES</p>
<p>Enjoy Free Games!</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
